# Normalize line endings so the repo stores LF and every checkout gets LF,
# regardless of platform or a contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout produces CRLF working files while Prettier
# writes LF — so `nx format:check` reports every line of a touched file as
# unformatted, even when nothing about its formatting actually changed. That
# false failure cost real time before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
